{{unit}}
[[Image:Simple Measuring Cup.jpg|thumb|A simple measuring cup]]
A '''cup''' is a US unit of volume measurement of volume equal to 16 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|US tablespoons]], {{sfrac|1|2}} [[Cookbook:Pint|US pint]], {{sfrac|1|4}} [[Cookbook:Quart|US quart]], or 8 [[Cookbook:Fluid Ounce|US fluid ounces]].
